            {'after': 5, 'q': 'How did Dayang Sumbi stop the spirits from finishing the boat?', 'options': ['She begged Sangkuriang directly to stop', 'She created a false dawn with torches and rice-pounding', 'She hid the boat overnight', 'She asked the gods to send rain'], 'correct': 1},
